#. えっと…
#. 今日はこれからどうしようかな…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hmm... What to do today?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 気にしてもしょうがない、放っておこう。
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"There's not much point in worrying about it now. I\n"
"should try to just forget about it..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. いや、意識しちゃダメだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera... I have to just act like I\n"
"don't even know it's there.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0005 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0006 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さんは…ここで…
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Right here is where Sayaka..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>この学園生活は…いつまで続くんだよ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>How long are we going to be stuck here, living out\n"
"this school life...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こっちも鉄板…あっちも鉄板…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Metal plate here... Metal plate over there, too.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そっちも鉄板…どっちも鉄板…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Metal plates everywhere I look...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このメモ帳…
#. 結局、舞園さんが使ったっきりだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I haven't touched this notepad since...Sayaka used it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>粘着テープクリーナー…
#. 減ったままだけど使わないからいいか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's my lint roller. It's missing some, but I don't\n"
"plan on using it, so it doesn't really matter.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>引き出しの中には工具セットが入ったままだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The toolkit is still sitting there in the drawer...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、まだ未使用…
#. この先もずっとそうだろうな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And still unused... I don't see that changing anytime\n"
"soon.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0017 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0018 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時間もあるし、少し休もうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have some time, so maybe I should take a little\n"
"rest...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>普通のゴミ箱だ。中にもゴミしかない。
#. ゴミが入ってこそのゴミ箱だもんな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a normal trash can. But there's no trash inside.\n"
"If there's no trash inside...is it really a trash can?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0021 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0022 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
